<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12114" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cȳ^cnus</span></b>  (in MSS. and edd.
		freq. also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cȳ^gnus</span></b> ;
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">y,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 4, 3, 20</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Aus. Ep. 20, 8</span></i>),
			i, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύκνος</span>, <i>the swan;</i> celebrated for
			its singing, esp. for its dying song; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">consecrated to Apollo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Tusc. 1, 30, 73</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Plin. 10, 23, 32, § 63</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Lucr. 4,
			181</span></i>; <i><span class="en">4, 910</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Verg.
				E. 7, 38</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. A. 1, 393</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 5,
				387</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hor. C. 4, 3, 20</span></i> et saep.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">attached to the chariot of Venus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 10, 708</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. A. A. 3, 809</span></i>.—
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> Prov.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quid contendat hirundo cycnis?</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr. 3,
					7</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">so also: certent cycnis ululae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					E. 8, 55</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Meton.</b>, for <i>a poet</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Dircaeus,</span>”
				i. e. <i>Pindar</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 4, 2, 25</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
